# Pinned so the PostToolUse hook reformats identically every run (idempotent → no churn).
# Recommend pinning the tool version too (e.g. via Mintfile/brew) and noting it in PROGRESS.md.
--swiftversion 5.9
--indent 4
--maxwidth 110
--wraparguments before-first
--wrapparameters before-first
--wrapcollections before-first
--commas inline
--trimwhitespace always
--semicolons never
--self remove
--exclude .build,DerivedData
